title: Times Square
text: Red down the street, blue up the avenue, and the Great White Way stays white. The city can only afford one gel.
trick: one multi-filter at the one crossing where street, avenue and Broadway meet: it reddens the street, turns the avenue blue and lets the diagonal through untouched, so three white beams from two splitters pass through it at once
motif: pictogram (a street grid of city blocks with Broadway cutting diagonally across every crossing)
expect: recolours>=1
---
L 0 12 2 w
T 14 6 0 r
T 8 0 0 b
T 10 4 0 w
*S 2 12 1 k
*R 2 6 5 k
*S 5 12 1 k
*B 5 9 5 k
*R 8 12 1 k
*M 8 6 2 k
T 5 11 0 w
